'''Funghi''' (なめこ, '''Nameko''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Neo Mushroom Garden Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Funghi
|image = E 264.png
|appearance = [[Neo Mushroom Garden Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 60¢ - 237¢
}}

==Enemy==
It may look somewhat strange at first glance, but this enemy is nothing to be worried about, treat it like the Mushroom Garden equivalent of [[Doge]].

==Strategy==
This enemy, with his Single Attack and low stats, won't be an issue for players who encounter it. Focus your strategy on whatever other units accompany it in stages, but do keep in mind that he could get in the way of certain cats with Single Attack, so bring [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Gross]] or other [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|wave units]] if you have it and plan to use Single Attack cats.

